'''RNG Juice''' is an {{Uncommon}} consumable. It is unlocked from the [[Raffle of the Century]] during Year 500.

== Obtaining ==
'''RNG Juice''' can be obtained as a {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]], or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Usage ==
'''RNG Juice''' can be used to grant progress towards an [[RNG Meter]] of the player's choice. The amount of progress granted is {{Green|1/10th}} of an {{Item|Ananke Feather}}.
